# AICL Example: Leap Year
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Is leap

Layer:
Core

Behavior Check
    Input: year
    Output: result
    Action:
        if year % 400 == 0:
            return true
        if year % 100 == 0:
            return false
        if year % 4 == 0:
            return true
        return false
